msgstr ""
"## Our commitment\n"
"We want an open, respectful and harassment-free community.\n"
"\n"
"## Expected behavior\n"
"- Treat other people with respect.\n"
"- Accept constructive criticism.\n"
"\n"
"## Unacceptable behavior\n"
"- Harassment, insults or discrimination.\n"
"\n"
"## How to report\n"
